SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Enabling Logistics Efficiency through Implementation of PM GatiShakti National Master Plan","publisher":"Press Information Bureau, Government of India","publication_date":"2022-02-28","url":"https://www.pib.gov.in/Pressreleaseshare.aspx?PRID=1801877&lang=2&reg=48","claim":"In a special address, the Prime Minister said PM GatiShakti was the first step toward integrated infrastructure planning, efficient coordination, and monitoring, and would reduce time and cost overruns in project execution; he also highlighted the central government's capex rise from Rs 2.5 lakh crore in 2013-14 to Rs 7.5 lakh crore in 2022-23.","locator":"PIB summary of the PM's special address","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct PM speech reported by the government, with a specific policy mechanism and spending figure.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within February 2022 and describing the 2022 program baseline.","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable to Modi as Prime Minister and to his own stated program.","contrary_evidence":["The speech and plan describe intended coordination; they do not by themselves prove later delivery."],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.2","8B.6","8B.10"]}
